{"hw":"ἀντεῖπον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀντεῖπον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀντεῖπον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 2</span> without any <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> (cf. <span class=\"gk\">ἀντερῶ, ἀντιλέγω, ἀνταγορεύω</span>), <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">speak against</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">in answer, gainsay,</b> c. dat., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">999</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τινὶ δεομένῳ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.136</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"gk\">οὐδὲν ἀντειπεῖν ἔχω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">51</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. πρός τινα</span> or <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">τι</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.61</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.3.3</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">oppose,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Thg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">131a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ὑπέρ τινος</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">speak</b> in one's defence, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">545</span> </span>: c. acc. cogn., <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ἔπος</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">utter</b> a word <b class=\"lex-tr\">of contradiction,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IA</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1391</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δύο λόγω περὶ τῶν αὐτῶν ἀντειπεῖν</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">speak on both sides of</b> a question, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τούτῳ ἂν δίκαιον λόγον ἀντείποιμι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">28b</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">κακῶς ἀ. τινά</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">malign</b> him <b class=\"lex-tr\">in turn,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1053</span> </span>.</div></div>"}